{"parentUuid":"f41ff01e-9f34-43cc-aaa1-574242fd7a51","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad57881598683395e","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf4J2go3Gz6vxgEAWWZ9U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017ZrCM5NacNeXa9ruvz7ixF","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md","prompt":"Override skill visibility from settings - what are the exact values accepted by skillOverrides?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":36857,"output_tokens":150,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":47},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":508},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":150,"cache_read_input_tokens":36857,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":508,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017ZrCM5NacNeXa9ruvz7ixF":{"url":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md","prompt":"Override skill visibility from settings - what are the exact values accepted by skillOverrides?"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf4J2g1f9A8CvYWzihhQe","attributionAgent":"claude-code-guide","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fa22488-db12-4517-b84e-2d701343e95d","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:40:33.441Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","perTurnEffort":null,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"7fa22488-db12-4517-b84e-2d701343e95d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"58366d6f-ebc8-4b8f-aaec-39fa7dcbe44b","agentId":"ad57881598683395e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ZrCM5NacNeXa9ruvz7ixF","type":"tool_result","content":"# skillOverrides Values\n\nBased on the documentation, the `skillOverrides` setting accepts exactly **four string values** for each skill:\n\n| Value | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| `\"on\"` | Skill is listed to Claude with name and description; appears in `/` menu |\n| `\"name-only\"` | Skill is listed to Claude with name only (no description); appears in `/` menu |\n| `\"user-invocable-only\"` | Skill is hidden from Claude's listing; appears in `/` menu (labeled as `user-only` in the `/skills` menu) |\n| `\"off\"` | Skill is completely hidden from Claude's listing and the `/` menu |\n\n## Example Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"skillOverrides\": {\n    \"legacy-context\": \"name-only\",\n    \"deploy\": \"off\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Points\n\n- **Default behavior**: Skills absent from `skillOverrides` are treated as `\"on\"`\n- **Non-interactive mode**: As of v2.1.199, `\"off\"` also hides skills from Remote Control clients and Agent SDK callers\n- **Invoking hidden skills**: Calling a skill by its full name when set to `\"off\"` returns a `skillOverrides` error instead of running it\n- **Plugin skills**: Not affected by `skillOverrides`; manage those through `/plugin` instead"}]},"uuid":"424b09ed-5905-491d-a28a-9700ac0a6af7","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:40:38.222Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":112699,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# skillOverrides Values\n\nBased on the documentation, the `skillOverrides` setting accepts exactly **four string values** for each skill:\n\n| Value | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| `\"on\"` | Skill is listed to Claude with name and description; appears in `/` menu |\n| `\"name-only\"` | Skill is listed to Claude with name only (no description); appears in `/` menu |\n| `\"user-invocable-only\"` | Skill is hidden from Claude's listing; appears in `/` menu (labeled as `user-only` in the `/skills` menu) |\n| `\"off\"` | Skill is completely hidden from Claude's listing and the `/` menu |\n\n## Example Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"skillOverrides\": {\n    \"legacy-context\": \"name-only\",\n    \"deploy\": \"off\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Points\n\n- **Default behavior**: Skills absent from `skillOverrides` are treated as `\"on\"`\n- **Non-interactive mode**: As of v2.1.199, `\"off\"` also hides skills from Remote Control clients and Agent SDK callers\n- **Invoking hidden skills**: Calling a skill by its full name when set to `\"off\"` returns a `skillOverrides` error instead of running it\n- **Plugin skills**: Not affected by `skillOverrides`; manage those through `/plugin` instead","durationMs":4663,"url":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7fa22488-db12-4517-b84e-2d701343e95d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
