{"parentUuid":"9de7c570-292e-4c29-9a9a-e4370cff10df","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad57881598683395e","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf4J3sHM8Q83DT3TvNNQ6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":37886,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":638,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf4J3rftcvfvp4zFiyF4s","attributionAgent":"claude-code-guide","type":"assistant","uuid":"f59d29d9-c405-45ae-b0f5-e9e021ed9f4b","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:40:49.086Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","perTurnEffort":null,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"f59d29d9-c405-45ae-b0f5-e9e021ed9f4b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad57881598683395e","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf4J3sHM8Q83DT3TvNNQ6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the documentation. Let me provide precise answers:\n\n## Answers from Claude Code Docs\n\n**1. Does `disable-model-invocation: true` remove a skill from model context?**\n\nYes — fully. Per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): \"The skill's **description is NOT in context** for Claude\" and \"Claude won't see it as an available option.\" The skill remains in the `/skills` menu for manual invocation but is invisible to Claude for auto-invocation.\n\n**2. What does `skillOverrides` accept?**\n\nPer [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md), exactly four values:\n- `\"on\"` — name + description to Claude\n- `\"name-only\"` — name only (no description)  \n- `\"user-invocable-only\"` — hidden from Claude, labeled user-only in `/skills`\n- `\"off\"` — completely hidden (also blocks via full name call)\n\nNo, `\"user-invocable-only\"` is **not** equivalent to `disable-model-invocation`. The key difference: `disable-model-invocation: true` still shows the skill in your `/skills` menu and you can invoke it; `\"user-invocable-only\"` hides it from Claude but also appears as user-only in `/skills`.\n\n**3. Is there a character/token budget for the skill listing?**\n\nYes, per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): combined `description` + `when_to_use` is capped at **1,536 characters** per skill. When exceeded, the text is **truncated at 1,536 chars**—not dropped. The settings `skillListingBudgetFraction` and `skillListingMaxDescChars` refine this further, but the documentation does not specify what happens when the overall budget is exceeded (whether skills get dropped entirely or just truncated). The docs indicate descriptions are cut short within the 1,536-char limit.\n\n**4. What does `user-invocable: false` do?**\n\nOpposite of `disable-model-invocation`. Per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): description **IS in context**, Claude can invoke it automatically, but **you cannot invoke it manually** with `/skill-name`. \n\n**Summary of what's not documented:** the exact behavior when the overall skill listing budget is exceeded (full skill removal vs. description-only truncation)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":37886,"output_tokens":723,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":127},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":638},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":723,"cache_read_input_tokens":37886,"cache_creation_input_tokens":638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":638,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf4J3rftcvfvp4zFiyF4s","attributionAgent":"claude-code-guide","type":"assistant","uuid":"ddae5004-2e2f-49e8-aae2-f47ea6c76b74","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:40:56.093Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","perTurnEffort":null,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
