{"parentUuid":"49383a55-8cd2-4ad9-b091-bad631d30f36","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"58366d6f-ebc8-4b8f-aaec-39fa7dcbe44b","agentId":"ad57881598683395e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"[Your previous response had no visible output. Please continue and produce a user-visible response.]"},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"12cc2ee7-f2a0-4b95-a5bf-aaf49a110c99","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:41:03.835Z","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"12cc2ee7-f2a0-4b95-a5bf-aaf49a110c99","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad57881598683395e","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf4J57LyB5QR5ngUFLTfA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22,"cache_read_input_tokens":39939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":22,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf4J573rZtXEUu3RWyJkK","attributionAgent":"claude-code-guide","type":"assistant","uuid":"06eff8f6-5b3e-4ead-8ae1-34ce57ecf1be","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:41:05.012Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","perTurnEffort":null,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"06eff8f6-5b3e-4ead-8ae1-34ce57ecf1be","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ad57881598683395e","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf4J57LyB5QR5ngUFLTfA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Claude Code Skill Configuration — Precise Answers from Docs\n\n**1. Does `disable-model-invocation: true` fully remove skill from model context?**\n\nYes. Per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): \"The skill's **description is NOT in context** for Claude\" and \"Claude won't see it as an available option.\" The skill remains in your `/skills` menu for manual `/name` invocation only.\n\n**2. What does `skillOverrides` accept?**\n\nPer [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md), exactly four string values:\n- `\"on\"` — name + description visible to Claude\n- `\"name-only\"` — name only, no description  \n- `\"user-invocable-only\"` — hidden from Claude, labeled user-only in `/skills`\n- `\"off\"` — completely hidden; blocks invocation by full name\n\n**3. Is `\"user-invocable-only\"` equivalent to `disable-model-invocation`?**\n\nNo. Key difference: `disable-model-invocation: true` keeps the skill in your `/skills` menu for manual invocation; `\"user-invocable-only\"` hides it from Claude but still appears as user-only in `/skills`.\n\n**4. Character/token budget for skill listings?**\n\nYes — per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): combined `description` + `when_to_use` is capped at **1,536 characters per skill**. Text is **truncated** at this limit, not dropped. Settings `skillListingBudgetFraction` and `skillListingMaxDescChars` provide additional control, but the docs don't specify what happens when the overall listing budget is exceeded.\n\n**5. What does `user-invocable: false` do vs. `disable-model-invocation`?**\n\nOpposite. Per [skills.md](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills.md): description **IS in context**, Claude can auto-invoke, but **you cannot manually invoke** with `/skill-name`.\n\n**Not documented:** exact behavior when skill listing context budget is exceeded."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22,"cache_read_input_tokens":39939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":22,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf4J573rZtXEUu3RWyJkK","attributionAgent":"claude-code-guide","type":"assistant","uuid":"82b9816c-c6f9-4c9e-9d84-e638edbc9df4","timestamp":"2026-09-15T00:41:08.747Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","perTurnEffort":null,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"83c30d83-83e3-464a-b3bb-0a18b5ea54cb","version":"2.1.271","gitBranch":"main"}
